// The Arc Howitzer: the Trebuchet's gun, and the Leviathan's Arc Cannons (the same tube,
// three to a house, nine to a broadside). A plasma cell charged and thrown: the charge is
// heard, then the shot.
//
// - The charge (`charge_time` before the shot) is a gesture that builds all the way to
//   the shot: the breech locks, the cells energise under a rough growl that climbs (held
//   rough, a long `fade`: never a clean note that rings), the containment throbs, the air
//   along the tube ionises into a fizz and crackle, arcs snap across the cells at uneven
//   gaps, sooner and harder, and over the last part it overloads and draws in a breath
//   before a lock-on slam. It is loudest the instant the shot goes; the release sits
//   under the fire sound. Its body is in the 150 Hz to 3 kHz band, heard over a battle.
// - The fire is a gun first: an electric snap, the cell dumping (a short low FM slam, no
//   buzz), the blast and a concussion that holds, the air torn open, the round tearing
//   away, the tube sizzling, and thunder rolling back for seconds. Nothing whistles or
//   falls in pitch as a tone: the only glides are noise and sub-bass.
//
// The Leviathan's are the same gestures at a warship's scale: three turrets' switchgear
// slamming in, a power plant spooling up under the growl, a longer overload, and a
// broadside that heaves the hull and rolls off the horizon for seconds.
//
// Every Roll has a pinned `seed`, so a swell measured once stays where it was (a louder
// random swell would push everything else down under the peak normalisation).
(
    sounds: {
        // ---- the Trebuchet's Arc Howitzer ------------------------------------------------
        "arc_howitzer_charge": (
            length: 2.85, peak: 0.7, room: 0.35,
            layers: [
                // The breech locks on the cell: a clack, a dull knock, a thunk.
                Burst(low: 250, high: 1800, attack: 0.0005, decay: 0.012, gain: 2.2, seed: 501),
                Fm(from: 180, to: 140, glide: 0.08, ratio: 1.41, index: 1.2, fade: 0.04, attack: 0.001, decay: 0.1, gain: 0.35),
                Tone(from: 110, to: 55, glide: 0.12, attack: 0.001, decay: 0.18, gain: 0.5),
                // The cells energising: a low hum and a rough growl over it, both climbing.
                Fm(at: 0.05, from: 55, to: 120, glide: 2.3, ratio: 0.5, index: 2.4, fade: 10.0, attack: 2.25, decay: 0.1, gain: 0.5),
                Fm(at: 0.05, from: 110, to: 260, glide: 2.3, ratio: 0.5, index: 2.6, fade: 10.0, attack: 2.2, decay: 0.08, gain: 0.55),
                // The containment throbbing, faster as it fills.
                Roll(at: 0.1, from: 200, to: 600, glide: 2.2, attack: 2.1, decay: 0.1, gain: 0.35, swell: 7, depth: 0.9, seed: 511),
                // The air along the tube ionising: a fizz and a crackle bed thickening.
                Sweep(at: 0.6, from: 600, to: 2600, glide: 1.7, q: 1.2, attack: 1.7, decay: 0.07, gain: 0.28, seed: 512),
                Roll(at: 0.5, from: 1200, to: 3000, glide: 1.8, attack: 1.8, decay: 0.08, gain: 0.25, swell: 60, depth: 1.0, pan: -0.2, seed: 513),
                // Arcs snapping across the cells at uneven gaps, sooner and harder; the big
                // ones sizzle after.
                Burst(at: 0.45, low: 900, high: 3000, attack: 0.0002, decay: 0.003, gain: 0.5, pan: -0.3, seed: 520),
                Burst(at: 0.83, low: 900, high: 3000, attack: 0.0002, decay: 0.003, gain: 0.6, pan: 0.35, seed: 521),
                Burst(at: 1.12, low: 700, high: 2800, attack: 0.0002, decay: 0.006, gain: 1.0, pan: -0.1, seed: 522),
                Roll(at: 1.12, from: 2400, to: 500, glide: 0.1, attack: 0.001, decay: 0.08, gain: 0.3, swell: 90, depth: 1.0, pan: -0.1, seed: 523),
                Burst(at: 1.36, low: 900, high: 3000, attack: 0.0002, decay: 0.003, gain: 0.8, pan: 0.3, seed: 524),
